{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgovb28rdwKd8QQfxAXhM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm going to answer it like a voice message to my friend.\n\n\"OK so. The page is literally called 'מה האתר עוד לא מכסה', what the site doesn't cover yet. Pretty sure the answer is just this list of cards. Every card has a little red 'לא מחושב' tag, so the site doesn't calculate or compare any of those. From what I got through: ETC, gold (the 'LBMA Gold Price' one and 'השקעה בזהב דרך קרנות סל'), אג״ח קונצרניות, Israel bonds (אגרות בונדס), a digital currency wallet, a few kinds of life insurance, structured products and structured deposits, foreign-currency deposits and deposits linked to the dollar, money-market funds with a dollar thing, and REITs (קרן להשקעות במקרקעין). There's a red banner up top that says the laws and rules for all of these are still being checked, and until that's done the site won't calculate them.\n\nThe good part: I didn't see 'S&P' or 'Nasdaq' or a plain index fund in that list. So maybe the stuff I actually want is covered? But that's a guess, not something I saw. I quit around the seventh screen and the list kept going. So I'm fairly sure about what I saw, not sure the list is complete.\n\nHow it went: dark, modern design, looked fine at first glance. Read the title and the red banner, then just headings and the red tags. Some cards had folds called 'מצב הכיסוי' that were already open, with 'חסום: שאלה פתוחה' and codes like 'MF-28' and 'TXA-28'. No idea what those mean, I skipped them. All the tiny teal law citations and dates I ignored.\n\nWords I didn't get: 'מצב הכיסוי', 'חסום: שאלה פתוחה', 'MF-28', 'TX2-01', 'TXA-28', 'לפי החברה', 'מקור ראשי (עותק)', 'קרן י׳', 'ני״ע', 'מוצר מובנה', 'פוליסה משתתפת ברווחים', 'אג״ח', and the crossed-out 'נסגר ב־' dates.\n\nWhere I'd close it: about screen 4–5, when I realised it's just an endless grid of the same card. It's honestly kind of scary, so much stuff the site can't do. I did read the securities-account guide earlier, the one with the 'כמה זה עולה' table where everything says 'אין תקרה בחוק', no legal cap on fees, which is not exactly reassuring.\""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3747,"cache_read_input_tokens":16894,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3747},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0ef29248-7434-4749-ab2b-d8b466ed6b4a","uuid":"64be3df1-9226-4da2-8eee-dce3511ee116","timestamp":"2026-11-07T17:00:08.814Z","request_id":"req_011Cgovb1sDvgXFV8cJjCyLp"}
